      "side": 1,
      "message": "Without weighing in on the vote here, I think we could probably get away with `gatherer-\u003eneedsLocalCoords() || !this-\u003egetLocalMatrix().isIdentity()`... does that work? Presumably factoring the matrix off of SkShaderBase entirely will involve a lot of code shuffling and will need its own followup CL.",
